Subject: Your administrator has created your BEPA EIS account
Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<body style="margin:0;padding:32px;background:#f1f5f9;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#334155;">
<div style="max-width:560px;margin:auto;padding:32px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;">
    <h1 style="color:#1e293b;font-size:26px;">Welcome to BEPA EIS</h1>
    <p>Your administrator has created an EIS account for you.</p>
    <p>To get access to EIS, please use the link below to choose your password. Once you have saved your password, you can log in using this email address and your new password.</p>
    <p style="margin:28px 0;"><a href="{{resetLink}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 22px;background:#046bd2;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;">Set your password</a></p>
    <p>This link is valid for 24 hours and can only be used once.</p>
    <p>If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:</p>
    <p style="word-break:break-all;"><a href="{{resetLink}}">{{resetLink}}</a></p>
    <p>If you have questions about your account or access, please contact your administrator.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:28px;color:#64748b;font-size:13px;">BEPA EIS</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
